{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the world of <strong>ABSTRACTICA</strong>, where geometric shapes have gone rogue, and the emptiness is <i>all-consuming</i>. Traverse this vast void on your quest to collect mosaic pieces in an attempt to... well just to <strong>create</strong>! Because what sense is there in existing, when your only task is to <i>destroy</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this third person shooter with roguelike elements, you fight your favourite geometric shapes like <i>Triangles</i>, <i>Parallelograms</i> and even <i>Hexagons</i>, in order to progress and unlock abstract pieces of potentially beautiful art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between <u>Dark Mode</u> and <u>Light Mode</u>, to change the dynamic of the run on the fly, because who knows... Maybe a change of scenery has an effect on your fighting ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your weapon with a variety of cubes that will give you the ability to shoot<strong> harder</strong>, jump <strong>higher</strong> and be (a little more) <strong>indestructible</strong>. As your art collection grows, you can also unlock <i>attachments</i> to your mask, each with a <strong>unique functionality</strong> that makes every adventure into the void memorable.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3571580?t=1742392497","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3571580?t=1742392497","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/c5a78c9595e6dcd36d7e007adcd8e26b5c416906/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742392497","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/c5a78c9595e6dcd36d7e007adcd8e26b5c416906/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742392497","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the world of <strong>ABSTRACTICA</strong>, where geometric shapes have gone rogue, and the emptiness is <i>all-consuming</i>. Traverse this vast void on your quest to collect mosaic pieces in an attempt to... well just to <strong>create</strong>! Because what sense is there in existing, when your only task is to <i>destroy</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this third person shooter with roguelike elements, you fight your favourite geometric shapes like <i>Triangles</i>, <i>Parallelograms</i> and even <i>Hexagons</i>, in order to progress and unlock abstract pieces of potentially beautiful art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between <u>Dark Mode</u> and <u>Light Mode</u>, to change the dynamic of the run on the fly, because who knows... Maybe a change of scenery has an effect on your fighting ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your weapon with a variety of cubes that will give you the ability to shoot<strong> harder</strong>, jump <strong>higher</strong> and be (a little more) <strong>indestructible</strong>. As your art collection grows, you can also unlock <i>attachments</i> to your mask, each with a <strong>unique functionality</strong> that makes every adventure into the void memorable.</p>","developers":["Marciman Game Creations"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571580/054c994621292d7347d2b40a07562155a9f5ef83/header.jpg?t=1742392497","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112233,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112233/movie480.mp4?t=1742392496","max":"http://video.akam